## Golden: `fundere` sobre un embed genérico. La llamada promovida usa la
## especialización de la instancia (`Box_doubled_instN`) y su receptor es el
## campo del embed (`&(h.box)`), no el host.
import std.spark

rune Box shard T:
    value as T

enchanting Box shard T:
    weave doubled into T:
        return self->value + self->value

rune Holder fundere Box of int:
    tag as int

weave main into int:
    var h as Holder is with value is 5, tag is 1
    calling spark.println with "{h.tag}"
    calling spark.println with "{h.value}"
    var first as int is calling h.doubled
    calling spark.println with "{first}"
    set h.value is 6
    var second as int is calling h.doubled
    calling spark.println with "{second}"
    return 0
